  1824                              <1> ;  The imports: kernel32.dll only. An import directory entry, the import
  1825                              <1> ;  lookup table, the hint/name entries and the DLL's name; then the import
  1826                              <1> ;  address table, which the loader fills in, right below `next` (with the
  1827                              <1> ;  routine pointers after it), so that CALL [EBP+d8] reaches it.
  1828                              <1> ; =============================================================================
  1829                              <1> %macro  IMPORTS 1
  1830                              <1>         IMP     GetStdHandle
  1831                              <1>         IMP     GetConsoleMode
