  1850 000006B8 [DE07C0FF]          <1>         dd      dllname-IB              ; Name
  1851 000006BC [EC07C0FF]          <1>         dd      iat-IB                  ; FirstThunk: the IAT
  1852 000006C0 00<rep 14h>         <1>         times   20 db 0                 ; the null entry that ends the list
